<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 style="color: antiquewhite;">About DressKart India</h1>
    <nav class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i> <span>About Us</span>
    </nav>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-layout">
      <div class="about-content">
        <h2>India's Trusted Petroleum Uniform Manufacturer</h2>
        <p>DressKart India is a leading manufacturer and supplier of high-quality uniforms. We take pride in being a trusted name for petrol pump uniforms, crafted to deliver the right balance of durability, comfort, and professional appearance.</p>
        <p>Our uniforms are designed with good quality fabrics and precise tailoring to meet the demanding needs of everyday work while ensuring a smart and confident look for every wearer.</p>
        <p>Expanding beyond petrol pump uniforms, we also specialize in industrial uniforms that prioritize safety, strength, and utility for workers across various sectors. In addition, our medical uniforms are thoughtfully designed to reflect hygiene, comfort, and professionalism — perfect for healthcare environments where trust and care matter the most.</p>
        <p>At DressKart India, our commitment goes beyond stitching fabric — we deliver uniform solutions that build identity, enhance confidence, and support performance. Backed by innovation, strict quality standards, and customer-first values, we continue to serve businesses and industries with products that are reliable, stylish, and tailored to their needs.</p>

        <div class="about-highlights">
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <i class="fas fa-certificate"></i>
            <div>
              <h4>ISO 9001:2015 Certified</h4>
              <p>Certified by MyCert Quality Assessors for designing, manufacturing and sales of readymade garments. Certificate No. Q-707024072203</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <i class="fas fa-gas-pump"></i>
            <div>
              <h4>Official Brand Supplier</h4>
              <p>Authorized supplier for BPCL (Bharat Petroleum), HPCL (Hindustan Petroleum) and IOCL (Indian Oil) uniforms and accessories.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <i class="fas fa-industry"></i>
            <div>
              <h4>Full Uniform Solutions</h4>
              <p>From T-shirts, shirts, trousers, waistcoats to caps, belts, cash bags, I-cards, flags and machine covers — everything in one place.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
            <div>
              <h4>Bulk Order Specialist</h4>
              <p>Special pricing for petrol pump franchise chains ordering complete uniform sets for their entire staff.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="about-card">
          <h3>Why Choose Our Uniforms?</h3>
          <ul class="facts-list">
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> High-Quality Fabric — Long-lasting and easy to maintain</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Professional Branding — Matches official BPCL/HPCL/IOCL branding</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Comfort & Safety — Designed for all-day wear and protection</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Custom Fit — S to 3XL with tailoring options</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> ISO 9001:2015 Certified Manufacturer</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Pan India Delivery</li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Complete Sets Available</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="iso-badge">
            <i class="fas fa-award"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>ISO 9001:2015</strong>
              <span>Certified — Valid till July 2027</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-full mt-2">Contact Us for Bulk Orders</a>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h3>Brands We Supply</h3>
          <div class="brand-logos-about">
            <div class="brand-chip hpcl-chip">⛽ HPCL</div>
            <div class="brand-chip bpcl-chip">⛽ BPCL</div>
            <div class="brand-chip iocl-chip">⛽ IOCL</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.iso-badge { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; background:#d4edda; border-radius:8px; padding:12px 16px; margin-top:16px; }
.iso-badge i { font-size:28px; color:#27ae60; }
.iso-badge strong { display:block; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; }
.iso-badge span { font-size:12px; color:#555; }
.brand-logos-about { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:8px; }
</style>

